#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/docker.rst:2
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/docker.rst:4
msgid ""
"So far this document has covered how to add the VMware cloud integration and"
" has enabled users the ability to provision virtual machine based instances "
"via the `Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great feature "
"provided by |morpheus| out of the box is the ability to use Docker "
"containers and even support multiple containers per Docker host. To do this "
"a Docker Host must first be provisioned into VMware (multiple are needed "
"when dealing with horizontal scaling scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"So far este document tiene covered how to add el VMware cloud integration y "
"tiene habilitado users el ability to provision virtual machine based "
"instances via el `Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great "
"característica provided by |morpheus| out of el box es el ability to use "
"Docker containers y incluso support múltiples containers per Docker host. To"
" do este un Docker Host debe primero be provisioned en VMware (múltiples son"
" needed cuando dealing con horizontal scaling scenarios)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/docker.rst:6
msgid ""
"To provision a Docker Host simply navigate to the Clusters tab of the Cloud "
"detail page or Infrastructure > Clusters section. From there, click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD CLUSTER` to add a VMware Docker Host. This host will show "
"up in the Hosts tab next to other ESXi servers that were inventoried by the "
"VMware cloud integration. |morpheus| views a Docker host just like any other"
" Hypervisor with the caveat being that it is used for running containerized "
"images instead of virtualized ones. Once a Docker Host is successfully "
"provisioned a green checkmark will appear to the right of the host marking "
"it as available for use. In the event of a failure click into the relevant "
"host that failed and an error explaining the failure will be displayed in "
"red at the top."
msgstr ""
"To provision un Docker Host simply navigate to el Clusters pestaña of el "
"Cloud página de detalles o Infrastructure > Clusters sección. Desde elre, "
"click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR CLUSTER` to add un VMware Docker Host. This host "
"será show up in el Hosts pestaña siguiente to otro ESXi servers que fueron "
"inventoried by el VMware cloud integration. |morpheus| views un Docker host "
"solo like cualquier otro Hypervisor con el caveat being que it se utiliza "
"para running containerized images en cambio of virtualized ones. Once un "
"Docker Host es successfully provisioned un green checkmark será appear to el"
" right of el host marking it as disponible para use. En el evento of un "
"failure click en el relevante host que fallido y un error explaining el "
"failure se mostrará in red en la parte superior."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/docker.rst:8
msgid ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For a Docker Host "
"to function properly, it must be able to resolve the |morpheus| appliance "
"url which can be configured in |AdmSet|. If it is unable to resolve and "
"negotiate with the appliance than the agent installation will fail and "
"provisioning instructions will not be able to be issued to the host."
msgstr ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For un Docker Host"
" to función properly, it debe be able to resolve el |morpheus| appliance url"
" cual se puede configurar in |AdmSet|. If it es unable to resolve y "
"negotiate con el appliance than el agente instalación será fail y "
"provisioning instructions no be able to be issued to el host."
